    "source": {
      "value": "rust"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Either as a punishment or because of political ambition, you work for Elder Vandous. On her trip to Iron Harbor, Elder Ordwi needs someone at her side who is a skilled observer and adept at keeping journals; she hopes to provide the other elders with accurate information about their sibling village upon her return.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Society skill and the Demon Lore skill. You gain the Streetwise skill feat."
    },
